From c8cc50e7dc5d62086e5396c176840c2b768228df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Weber <aweber.kernel@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Aug 2024 22:42:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 56/89] power: supply: max77693: Set of_node property of
 charger config

This is necessary for the power supply subsystem to locate the charger
by its device tree node, which we need to set it as a supplying PSU
to the battery.

Signed-off-by: Artur Weber <aweber.kernel@gmail.com>
[ grimler: change from of_node to fwnode to make it work with 6.17+ ]
Signed-off-by: Henrik Grimler <henrik@grimler.se>
---
 drivers/power/supply/max77693_charger.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/max77693_charger.c b/drivers/power/supply/max77693_charger.c
index 6f0fdc9ad..6049f3f0c 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/max77693_charger.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/max77693_charger.c
@@ -947,6 +947,7 @@ static int max77693_charger_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	chg->max77693 = max77693;
 
 	psy_cfg.drv_data = chg;
+	psy_cfg.fwnode = dev_fwnode(&pdev->dev);
 
 	chg->charger = devm_power_supply_register(&pdev->dev,
 						  &max77693_charger_desc,
-- 
2.53.0

